# Setup page
DoliCatalogSetup = Doli Catalog setup
DoliCatalogSetupIntro = Doli Catalog adds a "Browse catalog" button to the line entry form of customer proposals, sales orders, customer invoices, supplier proposals, purchase orders and supplier invoices. It reads native Dolibarr product categories and products; nothing in the core is modified.
DoliCatalogSettings = Settings
DoliCatalogDisplay = Display
DoliCatalogBehaviour = Behaviour

ShowStock = Show stock
ShowStockDesc = Show a stock column, and a warehouse filter when the Stock module is enabled.
ShowTtc = Show price including tax
ShowTtcDesc = Show a second price column with the tax-inclusive price.
ShowImages = Show thumbnails
ShowImagesDesc = Show the first product photo on each row. Turn this off on very large catalogs to reduce disk reads.
ShowDuration = Show service duration
ShowDurationDesc = Show a duration column for items of type Service.
EnableFavorites = Enable favorites
EnableFavoritesDesc = Let each user star items and reach them from a Favorites tab.
EnableRecent = Enable recently used
EnableRecentDesc = Keep a per-user history of recently picked items.
HideEmptyCategories = Hide empty categories
HideEmptyCategoriesDesc = Hide category folders that contain no matching items.
MaxResults = Maximum rows
MaxResultsDesc = Rows returned per query before the list is truncated. Between 1 and 500.
RecentCount = Recent items kept
RecentCountDesc = Recently used items remembered per user. Between 1 and 100.
DefaultQty = Default quantity
DefaultQtyDesc = Quantity pre-filled when an item is selected. Between 1 and 9999.
ButtonIcon = Trigger button icon
ButtonIconDesc = Font Awesome class for the "Browse catalog" button, for example fa-th-large or fa-list.
RootCategories = Root categories
RootCategoriesDesc = Categories shown at the top level of the catalog. Select none to show every top-level category.
DebugMode = Debug mode
DebugModeDesc = Expose a diagnostic endpoint at /custom/dolicatalog/ajax/debug.php for troubleshooting catalog queries, permissions and module configuration.

# Errors surfaced from the AJAX endpoints
UnsupportedDocumentType = This document type is not supported by Doli Catalog.
DocumentNotFound = The document could not be loaded.
DocumentNotDraft = Lines can only be added to a draft document.
NothingSelected = No item was selected.
ProductNotForSale = This item is not flagged for sale.
ProductNotForPurchase = This item is not flagged for purchase.
AddLineFailed = The line could not be added.
DoliCatalogThisSupplierOnly = This supplier only
DoliCatalogThisSupplierOnlyTooltip = Show only items that have a purchase price recorded for this supplier. Uncheck to browse every purchasable item.

