DoliCatalogTypeFilterTooltip = Limit the list to products only or services only
DoliCatalogWarehouseTooltip = Pick a warehouse to show its stock instead of the total across all warehouses
DoliCatalogAddSelectedTooltip = Add every selected item to this document as a new line
DoliCatalogCancelTooltip = Close without adding anything
DoliCatalogOpenCategory = Open {0}
DoliCatalogSelectItem = Select {0}
DoliCatalogRemoveItem = Remove {0} from the selection
DoliCatalogQtyTooltip = Quantity to add. Typing here selects the item.
DoliCatalogStockWarehouse = Stock in the selected warehouse
DoliCatalogStockAll = Stock across all warehouses
DoliCatalogServiceNoStock = Services are not stocked
DoliCatalogClearSelectionTooltip = Remove every item from the selection
DoliCatalogFavoritesTooltip = Show only the items you starred
DoliCatalogRecentTooltip = Show the items you picked most recently
DoliCatalogMatchingCategories = Matching categories
DoliCatalogOpenProduct = Open product card in a new tab
DoliCatalogBrowseMenu = Catalog
DoliCatalogBrowseTitle = Product catalog
DoliCatalogBrowseIntro = Browse the catalog by category, or search across every product and category name. Selecting items into a document is done from the Browse catalog button on a quote, order, invoice or bill of materials.
DoliCatalogBrowseEmpty = No product categories exist yet.
DoliCatalogPrevious = Previous
DoliCatalogNext = Next
DoliCatalogNoSubcategories = No subcategories
DoliCatalogClearCategoryFilter = Clear category filter
ListTree = Category filter on product list
ListTreeDesc = Add a category strip above the native product list. Clicking a category filters to that category and everything beneath it, which the built-in filter cannot do. Sorting, columns, mass actions and export are unaffected.
DoliCatalogRefineBy = Refine by
DoliCatalogClearTags = Clear all
DoliCatalogOtherTags = Other
DoliCatalogMoreValues = more
AttributeRoots = Attribute roots
AttributeRootsDesc = Categories whose direct children name an attribute, for example a category called Attribute holding Material, Thread Type and Thread Size. Values beneath them are grouped under their attribute name when refining a category, ordered by each category's own Position. Select none to show tags as one flat list.
DoliCatalogMatchAll = All
DoliCatalogMatchAny = Any
DoliCatalogMatchAllHint = Showing items matching all selected values. Click to allow any.
DoliCatalogMatchAnyHint = Showing items matching any selected value. Click to require all.
DoliCatalogFiltersActive = active
ArchivedCategory = Archived category
ArchivedCategoryDesc = Products in this category, or any category beneath it, are hidden from the catalog, the picker and search, along with the category itself. Select None to disable. A checkbox on the catalog page shows them when needed.
DoliCatalogShowArchived = Show archived
MaxFacets = Maximum tag filters
MaxFacetsDesc = Tag filters offered before the list is cut, keeping the most used. The catalog says how many were cut when it happens. Between 10 and 500.
DoliCatalogMoreTagsHidden = more not shown
DoliCatalogMoreTagsHiddenTooltip = Raise the tag filter limit in the module setup to show more.
